# QDQC · Asset Usage

## Source of truth

- Raw files: `assert/image/*.png`, `assert/music/*.mp4` (actually AAC/M4A audio).
- App consumes copies under `web/public/` only.
- Registry: `web/src/data/assets.ts` maps id → path → chapter → role.

## Image map (sheet → role)

| File | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `001`–`002` | Logo / brand mark variants |
| `003`–`006` | NFC card + character posters |
| `007` `011` | Desktop / ending hero references |
| `008` | Butterfly poses + flight sequence |
| `009` | Magpie poses + flight sequence |
| `010` | Magpie bridge layers / times of day |
| `012`–`13` `16`–`18` | Storyboard / scene boards |
| `14` `15` | Present-life memory chapters |
| `19`–`22` | UI kit (desktop + mobile) |

Treat sheets as **design references**. Crop export layers into `web/public/media/` when implementing; do not edit sheets in place.

## Music map → chapters

| Track | Chapter |
| --- | --- |
| `PROLOGUE 01` | NFC / Touch |
| `ACT I 02` / `03` | Prayer / Response |
| `ACT II 04` / `05` | Butterfly / Magpie Bridge |
| `ACT III・前世` + `07` `08` | Past |
| `ACT IV・今世` + `10` | Present / Quiet Days |
| `ACT V・山高路远` + `12`–`14` | Journey climax |
| `ACT VI 15` + `16` `17` | Return / Reprise / Ending |

Copy as `.m4a` into `web/public/audio/`; decode via Howler. Prefer stems later; v1 uses full mixes + crossfade.
